/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In the modern software development landscape, real-time collaboration is essential for efficient teamwork and productivity. Traditional coding environments often lack built-in communication tools, making it difficult for developers to work together seamlessly.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
376 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Our project, "Real-Time Collaborative Code Editor", is designed to bridge this gap by providing an interactive coding platform that enables multiple users to code simultaneously, communicate via voice chat, and use speech-to-text functionality for an enhanced development experience.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
377 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This platform is user-friendly and efficient, making it ideal for students, professionals, and remote teams. By integrating real-time synchronization, live voice communication, and a collaborative whiteboard, our project redefines remote pair programming and team-based coding, fostering a more engaging and intuitive software development process.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
