<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (With the increasing demand for remote collaboration, real-time collaborative code editors have become essential tools for developers, educators, and teams working on software projects. These platforms enable multiple users to edit and execute code in real time, enhancing productivity and communication. This literature survey explores existing solutions, their features, limitations, and the technological advancements that contribute to the development of such systems.)
/E (With the increasing demand for remote collaboration, real-time collaborative code editors have become essential tools for developers, educators, and teams working on software projects. These platforms enable multiple users to edit and execute code in real time, enhancing productivity and communication. This literature survey explores existing solutions, their features, limitations, and the technological advancements that contribute to the development of such systems.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
